(7810116, 1304304, 12200, '<td valign="top">
The framing and restrained monotone processing on this are key. It''s more than just an architectural candid; it''s something that invites a lingering gaze on wonderful little angles, thin little lines, and majestic gestures of poise. The art of this shot is its ability to encapsulate both the grandeur of the human achievement and the granularity of its conception.</td>', 'The framing and restrained monotone processing on this are key. It''s more than just an architectural candid; it''s something that invites a lingering gaze on wonderful little angles, thin little lines, and majestic gestures of poise. The art of this shot is its ability to encapsulate both the grandeur of the human achievement and the granularity of its conception.', '2026-02-17 21:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
